02:38:50.649 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
02:38:50.649   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
02:38:50.649   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
02:38:50.649   the client freezes on 'Connecting...'.
