02:38:50.649   NPC dialogue, mobs spawning and moving, an unequip that survives a map change.
02:38:50.649   NOT yet seen on screen: the shop counter, the quest journal, the channel
02:38:50.650   switch. Dropping an item is refused on purpose - there is nowhere to put it.
